        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "大帝",
        "content": "企鹅物流是不可取代的，而我更是不可取代的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[name=\"拜松\"]   既然如此，我们有很多种解决方法，为什么一定要和他们火拼起来？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "拜松",
        "content": "既然如此，我们有很多种解决方法，为什么一定要和他们火拼起来？"
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_102_texas_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[name=\"德克萨斯\"]   不知道。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "德克萨斯",
        "content": "不知道。"
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_102_texas_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[name=\"拜松\"]   不知道......你们，一直以来是怎么......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "拜松",
        "content": "不知道......你们，一直以来是怎么......"
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_105_emper\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[name=\"大帝\"]   好啦好啦，不要这么认真嘛，找个机会把他们的头儿揍一顿扔进江里，不就完事了吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "大帝",
        "content": "好啦好啦，不要这么认真嘛，找个机会把他们的头儿揍一顿扔进江里，不就完事了吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[name=\"大帝\"]   这场闹剧就和没能睡着的回笼觉一样浪费时间，我完——全提不起兴趣。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "大帝",
        "content": "这场闹剧就和没能睡着的回笼觉一样浪费时间，我完——全提不起兴趣。"
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_103_angel_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   就是嘛，这可不是什么值得认真讨论的事情。来，口香糖。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "就是嘛，这可不是什么值得认真讨论的事情。来，口香糖。"
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_103_angel_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 102,
        "raw": "[name=\"拜松\"]   ......唉。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "拜松",
        "content": "......唉。"
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[name=\"拜松\"]   但至少我们应该制定一个计划......等等，这口香糖是什么味道？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "拜松",
        "content": "但至少我们应该制定一个计划......等等，这口香糖是什么味道？"
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_103_angel_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
        "raw": "[name=\"能天使\"]   白马醇味。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "能天使",
        "content": "白马醇味。"
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_201_moeshd\",name2=\"char_102_texas_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "[name=\"德克萨斯\"]   把这个牌子的口香糖列入危险品范畴吧，可颂。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "德克萨斯",
        "content": "把这个牌子的口香糖列入危险品范畴吧，可颂。"
